    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγ-κρύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hide</i> or <i>conceal in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαλὸν σποδιῇ ἐνέκρυψε μελαίνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.488
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.Com.
				1.29
			</span></i>; [
